config BR2_PACKAGE_COREROUTER_FIRMWARE
	bool "corerouter-firmware"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_WIRELESS_REGDB
	help
	  The firmware the kernel's network drivers declare (G1.6j), from
	  the linux-firmware files pinned in firmware.lock, with their
	  licenses. `cargo xtask os build` downloads, checks and stages
	  them.

	  G1.30: and cfg80211's regulatory database, from the
	  wireless-regdb package: this package is the one that fills
	  /lib/firmware.
